---
permalink: /id/blog/
layout: null
title: "Blog Ekspor | Green Plus EXIM"
description: "Panduan pembeli berdasarkan produk dan pasar — spesifikasi, dokumentasi, logistik, dan harga untuk importir yang bersumber dari India."
lang: id
dir: ltr
rawTitle: true
noindex: true
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{% extends "layouts/base.njk" %}
{% block content %}
<section class="section" style="padding-block-start:var(--sp-3)">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Blog Ekspor</h1>
    <p class="lede">Panduan pembeli berdasarkan produk dan pasar.</p>
    <div class="grid grid--3" style="margin-block-start:var(--sp-3)">
      {% for post in collections.all %}
        {% if post.data.lang == "id" and post.data.category and post.url != "/id/blog/" %}
        <a class="card" href="{{ post.url }}">
          <div class="card-body">
            <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
            <p style="font-size:var(--fs-sm);color:var(--color-ink-muted)">{{ post.data.description }}</p>
          </div>
        </a>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% set formId = "id-blog-hub" %}
{% set thankYouUrl = "/id/thank-you/" %}
{% include "partials/cta-rfq-section.njk" %}
{% endblock %}
